<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria to offer 7.5 bln levs 6-mth T-bills Nov 1.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria to offer 7.5 bln levs 6-mth T-bills Nov 1.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry will offer 7.5 billion levs of six-month floater coupon T-bills at an auction on November 11, the central bank (BNB) said.</p>
<p>The issue will be offered with no minimum acceptable price set in advance by the ministry.</p>
<p>The coupon was set equal to the BNB's central interest rate (CIR) for the period to maturity. The CIR is now set at 15 percent monthly or 180 percent annually.</p>
<p>Details of the issue follow:</p>
<p> Issue number	 BG 3020296029</p>
<p> Auction date	 November 11, 1996</p>
<p> Issue date	   November 13, 1996</p>
<p> Maturity date	May 14, 1997</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 981 8569</p>
</text>
